scripts/ - repo-level helper scripts
====================================

    gen-compdb.sh   generate compile_commands.json for clangd, with per-file
                    flags matching lib/lib.mk and sw/sw.mk (incl. the optional
                    readline path). Replaces the old static compile_flags.txt.

Use it
------
    make compdb                    # -> ./compile_commands.json (git-ignored)
    sh scripts/gen-compdb.sh       # same, directly

Regenerate after adding a C source or changing include flags. The file holds
absolute paths (machine-specific), so it is git-ignored; `bear -- make` is an
equivalent if you prefer (bear is in the nix dev shell).
